  partName: Right Front Sensor (3)
  description: The Right Front Sensor (3) is a tiny, complex-shaped component located
    at the middle-right-front of the engine, responsible for monitoring and reporting
    engine performance data to the engine control unit. Constructed from Material.001,
    it ensures accurate and reliable readings. Interestingly, the Right Front Sensor
    (3) is designed to work in tandem with the Left Front Sensor (3), providing a
    comprehensive overview of engine performance and enabling precise control.
